{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9adb91a497cab1f3d76f527004616585c6607e4d5c1fca34214e1df6e1c9ce2a", "ja": "おーい、亜美！　衣装の試着中か？", "zh": "喂——亚美！你正在试穿演出服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "ea54b71c37319eed101e2ec0b2fe77c6b7bf81ca7a484375ad142bcc375462f8", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃん遅いよ～！　\n待ちくたびれて、キリンになっちゃうとこだよ！", "zh": "啊，哥哥，你来晚啦～！\n我都等得不耐烦了，差点要变成长颈鹿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "72a027bc3e9790f77f26157adf9f74b9f3d9e96ea5bf0a433359d4eef529b479", "ja": "えっ、待ってたのか？\n別に約束はしてなかったと思うけど……。", "zh": "咦，你在等我吗？\n我们好像也没约好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "6160b36c851c8b7393a7711eff57f1865781864a27b3a7f856a1710f594b9aac", "ja": "亜美が試着してたら、どこからともなく\nスーッと現れるのが、兄ちゃんっていう存在っしょ？", "zh": "哥哥这个存在，就是在亚美试衣服的时候，不知从哪里悄悄出现的家伙，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1e945287f63885f17891548cf0edb485258aaf33c55ae21d0cff3b2994fe30d9", "ja": "そうだったのか……まあ善処するよ。\nそれで、どうしたんだ？　何か用事か？", "zh": "原来是这样啊……那我会尽量想办法的。\n所以，怎么了？有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "cc70eccc5b50d854f67142ee28bf23f956dba621e57e4a11f590f3ba27a93839", "ja": "ドーシタもコーシタもワリシタもないよ！\n亜美のこの姿を見て、気づかないかね……？", "zh": "哪有什么怎么了、怎么办、怎么回事啊！  \n看到亚美这副模样，还没注意到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "681598a4de0bbb8c3dbc2ccb7cfaf42362442e782ccd5d0421a1277f2ebe5fa0", "ja": "ぷりちーでせくしーなモンスター……\n兄ちゃんは、とんでもない亜美を生み出してしまった！", "zh": "可爱又性感的怪兽……\n哥哥竟然创造出了不得了的亜美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e0c48bc3fb74f955bb154ceb12653a6e055a88616000d2d700eb18a0d1bf8456", "ja": "ハッ！？　そうだな……。\n確かに、すごく似合ってるぞ！　怖いくらいだ！", "zh": "哈！？说得对……  \n确实非常合适！简直合适得让人害怕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "4fd99da3784474a117bfdf19cefe69d124ae3fac65b4cc27978b5fadc81cd198", "ja": "そゆこと！　まさか、こんなメチャスゴ衣装を\n用意するなんて……兄ちゃんもワルですな～。", "zh": "就是这么回事！没想到居然准备了这么棒的服装……哥哥也真是坏心眼呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "e0275b21ae5e9f1d0e151941904b0843915b4b673be1d013b52e835c33e0c125", "ja": "もしかして、世界征服とか企んでる？\nパーフェクトアイドルな亜美のビボーを使って？", "zh": "该不会是在谋划征服世界吧？  \n利用完美偶像亚美的美貌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9781c1b378d3dc919a86d92c3d1e564ffcdf499f54a712f8805a9d16a91102e9", "ja": "まあ、アイドル業界の征服は狙ってるかも？\nそういう衣装も似合うと思ってたけど、正解だったな！", "zh": "是啊，说不定确实在打征服偶像界的主意？\n我本来就觉得你也很适合这种服装，果然没猜错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "7dd90d9a9e60e31d884f8be6027d6c15e800ee034e9dcb0ef8af4679d0d4656f", "ja": "いやぁ、兄ちゃんわかってるね、亜美のノリしろを。\n油断してるとはみ出すぜい！", "zh": "哎呀，哥哥很懂嘛，知道给亚美留出发挥的空间。一不小心就会溢出来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1012_p", "source_sha256": "57f6f289cb5828938b307157c1253f3cb06d7d27cfd9222af081b3072714ccbd", "ja": "そこはピッチリしてもらって……まあとにかく、\n亜美のポテンシャルを引き出す衣装だってことだな。", "zh": "那里就做得贴身一点……总之，就是能激发亚美潜力的服装，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "58ccc0c4c02d2f99c47f46fe780a656681bde701bf09d4817be62a29afac5ed0", "ja": "それそれー！　ぷりちー美少女亜美の魅力が、\nとどまるところを知らないよ？　うっふっふーん♪", "zh": "就是这个！可爱美少女亚美的魅力，简直势不可挡哦？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "928ed8d28a604c3e0188897c5011757c2e19f3aad4ce5c6b3a915c83fcf04d0d", "ja": "こんな衣装、普通考えつかないっぽいよ～？\n感じるよ、兄ちゃんのヨコシマな愛を。", "zh": "这种服装，普通人好像根本想不出来吧～？  \n我感受到哥哥那邪念满满的爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b95ec031cb4eb4c7527113271710d6cc6e234044dd2dbba778d032093c709f99", "ja": "ヨコシマじゃないが……。\n亜美のファンが喜んでくれるように、考えただけだよ。", "zh": "才不是别有用心……我只是想着，怎样才能让亚美的粉丝们开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "cdc553065a07fefbf5b8a8c336adcad196f6ca4a1c34a16b27dc465df404383d", "ja": "でもいいの？　兄ちゃん。亜美がモテモテになったら、\nあんま兄ちゃんに構ってあげられなくなるかもよ？", "zh": "可是这样真的好吗？哥哥。要是亚美变得特别受欢迎，可能就没法经常陪哥哥了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1017_p", "source_sha256": "de95e25ebe2d0a4f8cc8645fb12b85a8753d3976e8eafdedef8d505bd6412541", "ja": "当たり前だろ。プロデューサーとして、\n亜美が人気者になるのは、喜ぶべきことだよ。", "zh": "那是当然的吧。作为制作人，\n亚美能受到大家欢迎，是值得高兴的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "85df71bde694267f3f51a5ff9c01f4d9604d366ca794b2239597e16a6cef788d", "ja": "それに、もしそうなっても……\n亜美との関係は、変わらないと思うしな。", "zh": "而且，就算真变成那样……\n我和亚美之间的关系，应该也不会改变吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "63521326bfaca37f74bda542722873f6c833b5d3ef3dbacf9017b0a323da732a", "ja": "おおっ、兄ちゃん選手、ここでヨユーを\n見せつけてきた！　さすが、亜美が見込んだメンズ。", "zh": "哦哦，哥哥选手在这里展现出了游刃有余的一面！不愧是亚美看中的男人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "5d1543dc53554241c10302fc00735dc0c519544d774575c8b73331b2407d537e", "ja": "んじゃ、亜美も遠慮なく、大人気になっちゃおっかな♪\n忙しくなるから、覚悟しといてよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "那亚美也就不客气，变得超级有人气好啦♪\n到时候会忙得不可开交，做好心理准备哦，哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0354_1021_p", "source_sha256": "13590d87121274257bf3cfb1e90759155e30fcead147b02b83633c5ee5d5ccbc", "ja": "（また大きなこと言って……なんて、今の亜美を\n見たら言えないな。本当に、期待させてもらうぞ！）", "zh": "（又在说大话了……不过，看到现在的亚美，我可说不出这种话。真的很期待你啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
